# The build context is the repository root, and more than one build shares it:
# the reasoning images and the capability image. This file excludes only what no
# Dockerfile's COPY line reads -- every COPY source of every Dockerfile must
# survive it, and scripts/check_build_context.sh holds the two equal in both
# directions.
